{"ok":true,"name":"Bungo Stray Dogs on Stage: Dark Era","desc":"Before he joined the Armed Detective Agency, Osamu Dazai was the youngest-ever executive with the Port Mafia, the most notorious underground crime syndicate in all of Yokohama. Three of its members--Dazai, Odasaku, and Ango--formed a camaraderie despite their vast disparities in rank. When Ango suddenly goes missing, Odasaku, a lowly Mafia grunt, receives direct orders from their boss to find him...only for Ango's trail to lead Odasaku to a mysterious, foreign criminal organization called Mimic. At last, the reason why Dazai parted ways with the Port Mafia is revealed!","year":2018,"rating":null,"ratingCount":null,"thumb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bGGFSblNZzEYBoNcITKIN1yFK4Y.jpg","servers":[{"name":"Server 1","src":"https://videm.xyz/embed/movie/&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 2","src":"https://vidapi.xyz/embed/movie/1149600"},{"name":"Server 3","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vnest?tmdb=1149600&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 4","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vcr?tmdb=1149600&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 5","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vpls?tmdb=1149600&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 6","src":"https://embedmaster.link/movie/"},{"name":"Server 7","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vesy?tmdb=1149600&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 8","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vsrc?imdb="}],"genres":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"seasons":null,"duration":null,"imdb":null,"related":[{"id":34421,"slug":"the-perfect-weapon","title":"The Perfect Weapon","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCXDdDDgNxvtQVzBw9TfTz1QYjm.jpg"},{"id":79026,"slug":"el-padrino-the-latin-godfather","title":"El padrino: The Latin Godfather","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10J7EQ8WvMYku8lcZrLewV2Ko4I.jpg"},{"id":73499,"slug":"the-double","title":"The Double","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4W10sjJSDAWRUDn2Kb8DQKxiZv.jpg"},{"id":951470,"slug":"silverton-sie